/*
  AlertStudioPage.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0192 · AlertStudioPage (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface (table "AlertStudioPage").
  Every key the native AlertStudioPage resolves lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its strings without editing
  the shared catalog.

  The web i18next `{{token}}` interpolation is preserved verbatim (the native
  localizer substitutes `{{token}}`). The first groups are the EXACT static keys
  extracted from web/src/features/notifications/pages/AlertStudioPage.tsx; the trailing
  generated block covers the per-template / per-category keys the web builds from
  `templateKey(name)`, each falling back to the curated English exactly as the web
  `t(key, tpl.name)` call does.
*/

